  {
    "id": "2b828b918cd9085164d7",
    "source": "Spend one of a legendary creature's legendary actions at the END of another creature's turn: one option per turn that ends, never two at once. The server checks the pool (it refills at the start of the creature's own turn), the cost and the turn. If the action is one of its attacks, follow with enemy_attack naming the same attack; otherwise narrate the effect the block describes.",
    "sourceHash": "2b828b918cd9085164d755724feeb4bede270c3f47b45200f67728609b796ad3",
