  {
    "id": "d81ab7ddc92de68a5a4b",
    "source": "Spend one use of Legendary Resistance so the creature succeeds on the save it just failed this round. The server keeps the count and the last failed save: it lifts what that save laid and gives back the HP a success would have spared. With no failed save on record, or none left, it is refused. The server already spends one on its own when a failed save would leave the creature under a binding condition; use this for anything else (a damaging save it must not fail).",
    "sourceHash": "d81ab7ddc92de68a5a4baed3c2ff6daccdfefb82dc23d70b32d685e6fb30020e",
